# Antigravity Project Instructions & Architecture Guidelines

## Architecture & Package Structure Standards
Strictly follow the project clean architecture package structure across all code generation and modifications without needing repeated instructions:

```
app/src/main/java/com/examplealam292/pdfmaker/
│
├── MyApplication.kt
├── MainActivity.kt
│
├── core/
│   ├── common/
