## Layer Responsibilities
1. **`core/`**: Cross-cutting utilities, theme/design tokens, navigation routes/graphs, network clients, base classes.
2. **`data/`**: Data sources (Room DAOs, Retrofit/Ktor APIs, DataStore), DTOs, entities, and repository implementations.
3. **`domain/`**: Pure Kotlin business models, repository interfaces, and use cases (no Android framework dependencies).
4. **`feature/`**: Feature-specific UI screens, Jetpack Compose components, and ViewModels grouped by feature.
5. **`di/`**: Dependency injection modules (Hilt / Koin).
6. **`worker/`**: Background WorkManager workers.
